There *used* to be zi'a/zi'e/zi'o/zi'u, completing the ZIhEk spectrum, 
but it was determined for some reason that non-conjunctive conjunctions 
of relative clauses didn't make sense, and only zi'e was needed (and the 
other cmavo got repurposed for other things).

~mark

On 09/25/2016 05:37 PM, Jonathan Jones wrote:
> I remember a similar proposal made years ago, I think by .xorxes., 
